@startuml
actor User
participant "微信小程序端" as App
participant "Spring Boot服务端" as Server
database MySQL
User -> App: 发起下单请求
activate App
App -> Server: 发起下单请求
activate Server
Server -> Server: 获取当前用户信息
Server -> Server: 检查用户余额是否足够支付订单
alt 余额充足
    Server -> Server: 扣除用户账户余额
    Server -> Server: 更新用户账户信息
    Server -> Server: 生成唯一订单编号
    Server -> Server: 插入订单信息到数据库
    Server -> Server: 记录收支明细
    Server --> App: 返回下单成功消息
else 余额不足
    Server --> App: 返回余额不足错误消息
end
deactivate Server
deactivate App
@enduml
